  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat Team,\n\nWhen the avatar display limit (Maximum Shown Avatars) is active, could you please change the loading priority?\n\nInstead of only loading the closest avatars in a 360° radius, please prioritize loading avatars within the player's forward field of view (e.g., a 120° cone).\n\nThe current system often loads players behind me while the people I'm actually looking at from a distance remain unloaded. This breaks immersion, especially during events or when trying to talk to a group.\n\nPrioritizing what the player is looking at would make social interactions much more intuitive and reliable.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
